---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About DigiHawke Media | Growth Marketing Specialists"
  description="Meet the founders of DigiHawke Media: Vishal Gupta and Vinay Gupta. Learn about our marketing frameworks, and discover our core values and client scale pipelines."
>
  <!-- About Header -->
  <section class="pt-12 pb-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-lowest to-background relative overflow-hidden select-none" aria-label="About Header">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--color-surface-container-low),_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/5 mb-6">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-display font-extrabold tracking-wider text-secondary uppercase">Velocity & Precision</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 text-glow-indigo text-pretty">
        The DigiHawke Story
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-on-surface-variant font-sans max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We bridge the gap between heavy enterprise engineering reliability and high-speed growth marketing execution. We believe scaling is a quantitative science.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- True Founders Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-background relative z-10" aria-labelledby="leadership-title">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-20">
        <h2 id="leadership-title" class="text-xs font-display font-bold tracking-widest text-secondary uppercase mb-3">
          Our Leadership
        </h2>
        <p class="text-3xl font-display font-extrabold text-white leading-tight text-glow-indigo text-pretty">
          The Strategists Behind the Engine
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mt-4">
          DigiHawke Media was built on hands-on technical execution. Our founders continue to oversee high-level strategy and media deployment directly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Founder 1: Vishal Gupta (Detailed profile with Portrait) -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center mb-24">
        <!-- Portrait Image Column (5 columns) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
          <div 
            class="relative rounded-[8px] p-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-container to-surface-container-low border border-secondary/25 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group select-none max-w-[380px] w-full"
            style="box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(76, 215, 246, 0.15);"
          >
            <!-- Border lighting accent -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-secondary/10 via-transparent to-primary/10 opacity-60 pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <img 
              src="/images/vishal.png" 
              alt="Vishal Gupta, Founder & Strategy Director at DigiHawke Media" 
              width="360"
              height="360"
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-[6px] object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Founder Bio Column (7 columns) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-secondary border border-secondary/20 text-[10px] font-display font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase mb-4 self-start">
            Founder & Strategy Director
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2 leading-tight">
            Vishal Gupta
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-secondary font-mono font-semibold mb-6">
            Web Architect & Paid Media Strategist | Est. 2018
          </p>
          
          <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-5">
            <p>
              Over the past six years, Vishal has engineered digital growth across diverse industries. From launching robust e-commerce architectures to constructing paid acquisition pipelines, his approach is strictly quantitative and results-driven.
            </p>
            <p>
              Since 2025, Vishal has focused heavily on exploring AI tools, custom AI software, and building high-performance AI engines. Having rigorously tested AI solutions in every category, he has mapped exactly which AI tools yield tangible business value and which ones are not worth the overhead.
            </p>
            <p>
              As the Founder, Vishal manages full-funnel client strategy, conversion audits, and structural SEO setups, ensuring websites load instantly and traffic converts systematically.
            </p>
            
            <!-- Professional milestones/history -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/60 rounded-[4px] p-5 mt-4">
              <strong class="text-white block mb-3 font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Strategic Milestones:</strong>
              <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 list-none p-0 m-0 text-xs">
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                  <span class="text-secondary font-bold font-mono">2018–2020:</span>
                  <span>WordPress/Shopify web development, search engine indexing, and product optimization across Amazon, Flipkart, and Meesho.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                  <span class="text-secondary font-bold font-mono">2020–2022:</span>
                  <span>Advanced technical SEO audits, site speed optimization, and search console mapping using SEMrush and Ahrefs.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                  <span class="text-secondary font-bold font-mono">2022–2025:</span>
                  <span>Meta and Google ad campaigns, funnel building, and scale models for B2B, local brands, and scaling consultancies.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-2">
                  <span class="text-secondary font-bold font-mono">2025–Pres:</span>
                  <span>Exploring and vetting AI tools and custom software across all categories, building high-value automated AI marketing systems.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Founder 2: Vinay Gupta (Profile card format) -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Founder Bio Column (7 columns) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-center order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20 text-[10px] font-display font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase mb-4 self-start">
            Co-Founder & Lead Video Editor
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2 leading-tight">
            Vinay Gupta
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-primary font-mono font-semibold mb-6">
            Video Editor & Content Creator | 3 Years Experience
          </p>
          
          <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-5">
            <p>
              Vinay has spent over three years engineering high-retention video content and media strategies. Specializing in Adobe Premiere, After Effects, and CapCut, he edits short-form hooks, promotional campaigns, and brand storytelling videos that capture and hold attention.
            </p>
            <p>
              He manages our video post-production pipeline, ensuring all visual assets align with conversion goals and brand aesthetics to maximize click-through rates and customer engagement.
            </p>
            <p class="p-4 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60 text-xs italic">
              “Great editing isn't just about cuts; it's about pacing, rhythm, and keeping the viewer engaged every single second.”
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Portrait Image Column (5 columns) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-1 lg:order-2">
          <div 
            class="relative rounded-[8px] p-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-container to-surface-container-low border border-primary/25 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group select-none max-w-[380px] w-full"
            style="box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(195, 192, 255, 0.15);"
          >
            <!-- Border lighting accent -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary/10 via-transparent to-secondary/10 opacity-60 pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <img 
              src="/images/vinay.jpg" 
              alt="Vinay Gupta, Co-Founder & Lead Video Editor at DigiHawke Media" 
              width="360"
              height="360"
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-[6px] object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Regional Coverage Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface-container-lowest border-y border-outline-variant/30" aria-labelledby="coverage-title">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center select-none">
      <h2 id="coverage-title" class="text-xs font-display font-bold tracking-widest text-secondary uppercase mb-3">
        Regional Impact
      </h2>
      <p class="text-3xl font-display font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-6 text-glow-indigo text-pretty">
        Empowering East UP and Beyond
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-12">
        Rooted in Deoria, we represent growth pipelines in East Uttar Pradesh, driving local markets while serving enterprise clients globally.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Locations grid -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        {['Deoria', 'Gorakhpur', 'Mau', 'Ballia', 'Kushinagar'].map((loc) => (
          <span class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant text-sm font-semibold text-white tracking-wide hover:border-secondary/30 transition-colors">
            {loc}
          </span>
        ))}
        <span class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-[4px] bg-secondary/10 border border-secondary/20 text-sm font-semibold text-secondary tracking-wide">
          Global Scaling Engaged
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Registered Office Block -->
      <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-left">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-secondary border border-outline-variant flex-shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-display font-bold text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Registered Office</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-white font-semibold">Barhaj, Dist - Deoria, Gorakhpur</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">U.P - 274601, India</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-secondary border border-outline-variant flex-shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-display font-bold text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Email Us</span>
            <a href="mailto:help@digihawke.com" class="text-sm text-white font-semibold hover:text-secondary transition-colors">
              help@digihawke.com
            </a>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">We respond within 24 hours</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
